  "description": "The Wild Ronin pulls you irresistibly up the climb. You feel the connection to the ground - everything becomes one. Then comes the start of the descent, the rest is exhilaration. The Wild Ronin combines excellent climbing characteristics with a performance that will make your heart beat faster. Anchored in a carbon heart, the innovative 4-link swingarm rear suspension with RockShox shock and 140 mm travel provides you with maximum traction, efficiency and control for an outstanding trail experience. Equipped down to the last detail, the Wild Ronin equips you for all off-road challenges . The next trail is already waiting for you!",
